      "text": "```python\nimport numpy as np\n\ndef main():\n    X = np.load(\"vectors_secondary.npy\")\n    X = X.astype(np.float64, copy=False)\n    n = X.shape[0]\n\n    norms = np.sum(X * X, axis=1)\n\n    total = 0.0\n    chunk_size = 500\n\n    for start in range(0, n, chunk_size):\n        end = min(start + chunk_size, n)\n        Xc = X[start:end]\n        # dot products between chunk rows and all rows\n        G = Xc @ X.T  # shape (chunk, n)\n        d2 = norms[start:end][:, None] + norms[None, :] - 2.0 * G\n        # numerical safety: clip small negative values to zero\n        np.maximum(d2, 0.0, out=d2)\n        d = np.sqrt(d2)\n        total += np.sum(d, dtype=np.float64)\n\n    # total is a numpy float64 scalar; convert to Python float for printing\n    total_val = float(total)\n    print(f\"TOTAL:{total_val:.10f}\")\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n```",
